  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pes 802.01 Statement of Purpose. The purpose of these rules is to list the requirements for storing pesticides and pesticide containers by private and commercial applicators.\n\nSource. #5611, eff 4-13-93; ss by #6160, eff 1-3-96; ss by #7987, eff 1-3-04, EXPIRED: 1-3-12\n\nNew. #10489, INTERIM, eff 12-17-13, EXPIRED: 6-16-14\n\nNew. #10712, eff 11-5-14; ss by #13981, eff 5-31-24",
